WEBVTT

00:04:54.959 --> 00:05:00.031
based on the year of births of individuals
from 1400 to 1900,

00:05:00.055 --> 00:05:02.821
and we compared it
to known migration events.

00:05:03.482 --> 00:05:06.647
The clip is going to show you
that the deepest lineages in our data

00:05:06.671 --> 00:05:08.298
go all the way back to the UK,

00:05:08.322 --> 00:05:10.130
where they had better record keeping,

00:05:10.154 --> 00:05:13.436
and then they spread along
the routes of Western colonialism.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.782
Let's watch this.

00:05:15.143 --> 00:05:16.752
(Music)

00:05:16.776 --> 00:05:19.117
[Year of birth: ]

00:05:19.705 --> 00:05:21.541
[1492 - Columbus sails the ocean blue]

00:05:23.661 --> 00:05:25.661
[1620 - Mayflower lands in Massachusetts]

00:05:26.726 --> 00:05:28.501
[1652 - Dutch settle in South Africa]